WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.337
Welcome to Module 3. Functions help us turn repeated steps into named, reusable pieces of logic.

00:00:07.337 --> 00:00:14.297
Instead of copying the same calculation again and again, we can define it once, give it a clear name,

00:00:14.297 --> 00:00:16.528
and reuse it with different values.

00:00:17.029 --> 00:00:23.926
By the end of this module, you should be comfortable defining a function, passing values into it,

00:00:23.926 --> 00:00:29.654
returning values from it, and combining small functions into a simple workflow.
